WEBVTT

00:06:29.156 --> 00:06:35.076
I ask you to join me
in recognizing Africa's contribution,

00:06:35.116 --> 00:06:36.596
and collectively,

00:06:36.636 --> 00:06:40.836
we must ask the markets to recognize

00:06:40.876 --> 00:06:44.756
and adequately reward
Africa's contribution

00:06:44.756 --> 00:06:47.676
by putting a price on carbon.

00:06:47.716 --> 00:06:52.156
(Applause)